# Grist's +1 after Grist has left the battlefield (the ruling): Bot2 bolts her twice in response, so she is in the
# graveyard as the ability resolves. It still makes a token and mills, and still repeats on each Insect card milled
# (Haywire Mite, Icetill Explorer), putting no loyalty counter anywhere, and stops on the Llanowar Elves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bayou x3
Grist, the Hunger Tide
Forest x5
Haywire Mite
Icetill Explorer
Llanowar Elves
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt x2
Mountain x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#1.Activate(Ability: Add {B})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#2.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Battlefield.Bayou#3.Activate(Ability: Add {G})
Bot1.Hand.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide.Activate(Ability: +1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grist, the Hunger Tide)
[T5 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves; Icetill Explorer; Haywire Mite; Grist, the Hunger Tide
Bot1.Battlefield = Bayou; Bayou; Bayou; Insect Token; Insect Token; Insect Token
